r":false,"text":"一见面给人感觉乖巧，也有一旦作出决定，谁的话也不听的顽固的一面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从恋爱小说中得到的知识很丰富，却没有实战经验。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时非常喜欢恋爱小说，有严重的妄想症。一个人的时候会妄想十分不得了的事情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"绝对的处女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/466646e2a3fbd14245f744cfb85980695469d4d9bff1678a0433a7be7d9bc90e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e26dafb619c8ad70157bb3f9f69b00722f3c6f588bf88b8af4d524b34b17b39.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かぐや 凛子","creatorId":"vndb:s4309","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4309","name":"かぐや 凛子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:56368","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17958","characterName":"高中 茉莉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41595","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"98071"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2328"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17958"},"originalCharacterName":"高中 茉莉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会暮しに憧れる村の雑貨屋の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく元気で活発だけど、調子に乗ってドジることもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチなことに興味があるけれど、すぐに顔が真っ赤になる純情少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小学生時代主人公と交わした「お嫁さんにする」との約束を今でもしっかりと覚えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん処女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2328","sourceWorkId":"19862","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村中杂货屋的女孩子。向往着都市生活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然开朗健康活泼，兴奋过头是也经常犯傻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然对H的事情感兴趣，却会因为纯情而十分脸红。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小学时候，与还乡的主人公在暑假一起做广播体操而相识，抱有好感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在水边玩耍之时，偷偷的采花之时被主人公看见，说自己“再也嫁不出去了”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"无法停止茉莉哭泣，困惑中的主人公说到“那么就由我来娶茉莉酱好了”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"至今也清清楚楚的记着当时的话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然是处女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41595"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43486586688bbe1e5f20b5c7406afd16e3739285c80a0e6439d26cf226b5fcc7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09aaac1e7bca2315556f215b053f204b34e7a5445fbd911858f662f29a677368.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木緑 あかね","creatorId":"vndb:s4308","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4308","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4308","name":"木緑 あかね","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:56367","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23471","characterName":"雫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41597","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"98071"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2330"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23471"},"originalCharacterName":"雫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"化け狸の子孫。♀"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年若い娘に化けて、いたずらをしているが、地元民達は皆知っているので「また狸さんの仕業やぁ」 と騙されることが無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も知らず化かされる主人公が現われ、がぜんやる気になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、やたらと主人公に戦いを挑んでくるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たぶん処女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2330","sourceWorkId":"19862","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"狸猫妖怪的子孙。♀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然经常化作年轻的女孩子进行恶作剧，为当地居民所熟知，「又是狸猫干的好事啊」这样的感觉，温柔的守护着居民们。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在毫不知情的主人公面前出现，突然产生了想要捉弄他的冲动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也许是处女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41597"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d3ce3cdad122b3c03372496e2e1f231e0f6322136e60190b1634c6847c23a16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/205628e698fb8e101a2eb869587c2f7f2eb1181360177991e40a6fb946088477.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:98071:41597:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c23472","characterName":"汐見 鈴花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"41598","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"98071"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2331"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23472"},"originalCharacterName":"汐見 鈴花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻澤家の亜紗美専属メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢不詳でスキルレベルが異様に高いが、口が悪いのが玉にきず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"亜紗美に悪さをしようとする人、物、物の怪（雫）から彼女を守っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事も快く思っていないが、亜紗美が主人公に惚れちゃっているので苦々しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堅物なのできっと処女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2331","sourceWorkId":"19862","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻澤家的亜紗美专属女仆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年龄不详，各种技术水平异常的高，嘴上不饶人是唯一美中不足之处。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"保护亜紗美，防止人・物・怪物对她做坏事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来对主人公没有任何想法，却因为亜紗美迷恋主人公而变得十分讨厌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这么死板一定是处女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"41598"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/